# "Canonical JSON" names a family, not one function: keys sorted by UTF-16 code units or by
# code points, lone surrogates escaped or refused. Tilth's edge library has no edge called
# canonical-json; a spec that asks for one is told to choose (T015).
tilth 0.1

spec ambiguous 0.1

op canonical
  input value any

edge canonical-json via canonical value
